cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this courseware, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "OCW-RPL: Open Courseware Rekayasa Perangkat Lunak"
abstract: >
  Open courseware platform for the Rekayasa Perangkat Lunak (Software Engineering) course
  IMP307 at Universitas IPWIJA, Jakarta. 16 structured modules covering the full software
  engineering lifecycle: RPL fundamentals, feasibility studies (PIECES framework), project
  management (4P), SDLC models (Waterfall, Spiral, Agile, RAD), requirements engineering
  and SRS documentation, analysis modeling (DFD & data dictionary), software design
  (architectural, interface, and data design), testing strategies (White Box — Cyclomatic
  Complexity & Basis Path; Black Box — BVA & Equivalence Partitioning), and Software
  Quality Assurance (SQA, FTR, McCall's quality metrics). Powered by DonatJS micro-framework.
